Team —

Effective 12/10/2025, the legacy-accounts renewal rate schedule moves from 11% to 13%. The updated schedule (v2.0) is filed at:

    /MarketingOps/Pricing/legacy_accounts_rate_schedule_12102025.pdf

Please replace any working copies of the prior version with the v2.0 PDF and use it as the reference for inherited-Bramwell renewal quoting going forward.

A couple of clarifications while people have this open:

- The 13% figure is renewal-only. Ongoing monthly billing for inherited-Bramwell accounts between renewal events continues under Thornfield's standard rate card (12%) and is unaffected by this update.
- Thornfield-native accounts are outside the scope of this schedule entirely — no change there.
- The predecessor schedule (v1.0) has been archived at /MarketingOps/Pricing/Archive/legacy_accounts_rate_schedule_pre_12102025.pdf.

When in doubt on a specific account, ping me directly rather than guessing.

